        "original_id": "f6111ce7-31a0-57fa-b24b-a591dc46f19c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Cold Harbor, Second Battle of Bull Run, Battle of Second Manassas\n- Places: Prince William County, Virginia\n- Topics: American Civil War\n\nFacts:\n- The Second Battle of Bull Run, also called the Battle of Second Manassas, was fought on August 28–30, 1862.\n- The Second Battle of Bull Run took place in Prince William County, Virginia, as part of the American Civil War.\n- The Battle of Cold Harbor was fought from May 31 to June 12, 1864.\n- The most significant fighting in the Battle of Cold Harbor occurred on June 3, 1864.",
